OL,3,GNEWSAMan released after fatal crash as
OL,4,Ainquiries continue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was arrested after a fatal
OL,7,Fcrash in Leicester has been released
OL,8,Fpending further inquiries.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said a grey
OL,11,FVolkswagen Golf crashed into a parked
OL,12,Fvehicle in Chesterfield Road just
OL,13,Fbefore 05:49 GMT on Saturday.
OL,15,FA man - one of two occupants in the
OL,16,FGolf - suffered serious injuries and
OL,17,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,18,FAnother man was taken to hospital with
OL,19,Fminor injuries and was discharged after
OL,20,Ftreatment, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
