OL,3,GNEWSAMan released after fatal crash as
OL,4,Ainquiries continue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 29-year-old man was detained on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of causing death by dangerous
OL,8,Fdriving. Anyone with any information
OL,9,Fhas been urged to contact the force.
